      "description": "Recommendation 1: Bundle CPT 59510 once per pregnancy when 59400 or 59430 is billed for the same pregnancy and same TIN; do not separately reimburse duplicate global obstetrical claims outside the assistant surgeon cesarean-delivery exception. Exempt: assistant surgeon cesarean deliveries. Peer: Elevance Health external and Elevance Health internal both apply 59510 only once per pregnancy for the same pregnancy and same TIN, paired against 59400 and 59430..\n\nRecommendation 2: Allow delivery-only cesarean CPT 59514 or 59620 only on an assistant surgeon claim when modifier 80, 81, 82, or AS is present on the same claim line; otherwise bundle under the global maternity package, and bundle delivery admissions within 72 hours. Exempt: 22.",
